  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"6c959d3f\" id=\"6c959d3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfc3f3df\" id=\"ucfc3f3df\">URDF 双足机器人建模入门教程 </span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"a88b393f\" id=\"a88b393f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f8477aa\" id=\"u3f8477aa\">从零编写一个简单双足机器人 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud7b9a059\" id=\"ud7b9a059\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"452ec7d1\" id=\"452ec7d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub294a751\" id=\"ub294a751\">1. 什么是 URDF </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud0011d6e\" id=\"ud0011d6e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua28f1347\" id=\"ua28f1347\">URDF (Unified Robot Description Format)</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u618adbab\" id=\"u618adbab\"> 是 ROS 中用于描述机器人模型的 XML 格式文件。它定义了：</span></p><ul list=\"u130e3651\"><li fid=\"ua15f4aaa\" data-lake-id=\"u4ddaa0f0\" id=\"u4ddaa0f0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u644806d2\" id=\"u644806d2\">Link（连杆）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua8dc501d\" id=\"ua8dc501d\">：机器人的刚体部分（如大腿、小腿、躯干）</span></li><li fid=\"ua15f4aaa\" data-lake-id=\"u1576165b\" id=\"u1576165b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6e0622bc\" id=\"u6e0622bc\">Joint（关节）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9060a046\" id=\"u9060a046\">：连接两个 Link 的运动副（如髋关节、膝关节）</span></li><li fid=\"ua15f4aaa\" data-lake-id=\"udf470cd9\" id=\"udf470cd9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0ace0286\" id=\"u0ace0286\">Material（材质）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf6717fcf\" id=\"uf6717fcf\">：外观颜色 给人看的</span></li><li fid=\"ua15f4aaa\" data-lake-id=\"u886233de\" id=\"u886233de\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u932ccb80\" id=\"u932ccb80\">Inertial（惯量）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u27eae3c3\" id=\"u27eae3c3\">：物理属性（质量、转动惯量）   sim2real非常关键  系统辨识</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ua196d1a4\" id=\"ua196d1a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8740c3d\" id=\"ud8740c3d\">本教程将带你从零创建一个简单的双足机器人模型。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xlYYU%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"e1c1fc65\" id=\"e1c1fc65\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61f3df21\" id=\"u61f3df21\">2. 准备工具 </span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"0edd1fde\" id=\"0edd1fde\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8fe675d7\" id=\"u8fe675d7\">必需工具 </span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E8%AE%B0%E4%BA%8B%E6%9C%AC%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E5%99%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AEnotepad%2B%2B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SxFqU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"a3fb8ffc\" id=\"a3fb8ffc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda79612c\" id=\"uda79612c\">推荐编辑器 </span></h3><ul list=\"u7620e6cf\"><li fid=\"uca280de8\" data-lake-id=\"u04b3fb7e\" id=\"u04b3fb7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63c6562c\" id=\"u63c6562c\">VS Code（安装 XML 插件）</span></li><li fid=\"uca280de8\" data-lake-id=\"u53141972\" id=\"u53141972\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud529e7e3\" id=\"ud529e7e3\">Sublime Text</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pUPZ6%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"500e5d2a\" id=\"500e5d2a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ca11d3e\" id=\"u6ca11d3e\">3. 第一步：文件骨架 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u61e6a887\" id=\"u61e6a887\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6156311f\" id=\"u6156311f\">新建文件 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4172d9b7\" id=\"u4172d9b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d49acfd\" id=\"u7d49acfd\">simple_biped.urdf</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc9f44cc7\" id=\"uc9f44cc7\">，写入基本结构：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3C%3Fxml%20version%3D%5C%221.0%5C%22%3F%3E%5Cn%3Crobot%20name%3D%5C%22simple_biped%5C%22%3E%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%3C!--%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%20--%3E%5Cn%5Cn%3C%2Frobot%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IbfKp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udf17b9af\" id=\"udf17b9af\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a58ee05\" id=\"u4a58ee05\">要点：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ua079f93e\"><li fid=\"ue2ac39ac\" data-lake-id=\"u3bb4e7b6\" id=\"u3bb4e7b6\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua9dfb262\" id=\"ua9dfb262\"><span data-lake-id=\"u704d4836\" id=\"u704d4836\">&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u73d0b471\" id=\"u73d0b471\">：XML 声明，必须放在第一行</span></li><li fid=\"ue2ac39ac\" data-lake-id=\"ubaf0e661\" id=\"ubaf0e661\"><code data-lake-id=\"u69d4d7b3\" id=\"u69d4d7b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ec7f86d\" id=\"u8ec7f86d\">&lt;robot name=&quot;simple_biped&quot;&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2cd2b078\" id=\"u2cd2b078\">：根标签，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u28cc231c\" id=\"u28cc231c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51e7924b\" id=\"u51e7924b\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucdcaf408\" id=\"ucdcaf408\"> 是机器人名称</span></li><li fid=\"ue2ac39ac\" data-lake-id=\"u8d3f14a4\" id=\"u8d3f14a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u66290f48\" id=\"u66290f48\">所有内容都必须写在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1cb7a2ae\" id=\"u1cb7a2ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13a6ebc0\" id=\"u13a6ebc0\">&lt;robot&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub2f6144d\" id=\"ub2f6144d\"> 标签内</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VeqmD%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"8c284e8e\" id=\"8c284e8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucec4b58a\" id=\"ucec4b58a\">4. 第二步：定义外观颜色 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc758bd26\" id=\"uc758bd26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e8b0a4e\" id=\"u5e8b0a4e\">为了让机器人更好看，我们先定义三种颜色材质：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3C%3Fxml%20version%3D%5C%221.0%5C%22%3F%3E%5Cn%3Crobot%20name%3D%5C%22simple_biped%5C%22%3E%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%3C!--%20%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%9D%90%E8%B4%A8%20%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%3Cmaterial%20name%3D%5C%22torso_red%5C%22%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Ccolor%20rgba%3D%5C%220.85%200.25%200.25%201.0%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C%2Fmaterial%3E%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%3Cmaterial%20name%3D%5C%22right_leg_blue%5C%22%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Ccolor%20rgba%3D%5C%220.25%200.35%200.85%201.0%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C%2Fmaterial%3E%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%3Cmaterial%20name%3D%5C%22left_leg_green%5C%22%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Ccolor%20rgba%3D%5C%220.25%200.8%200.35%201.0%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C%2Fmaterial%3E%5Cn%5Cn%3C%2Frobot%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bsN4H%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue583d593\" id=\"ue583d593\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0eddacf0\" id=\"u0eddacf0\">颜色格式说明：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ue47d39eb\"><li fid=\"ufe0e4608\" data-lake-id=\"u67acfe9e\" id=\"u67acfe9e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u99e8380d\" id=\"u99e8380d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52a3dc34\" id=\"u52a3dc34\">rgba=&quot;R G B A&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u77c8627f\" id=\"u77c8627f\">：红、绿、蓝、透明度</span></li><li fid=\"ufe0e4608\" data-lake-id=\"u82154bd9\" id=\"u82154bd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4567e48\" id=\"ue4567e48\">取值范围：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8a44c9fe\" id=\"u8a44c9fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u031d80d8\" id=\"u031d80d8\">0.0 ~ 1.0</span></code></li><li fid=\"ufe0e4608\" data-lake-id=\"u20e4be9f\" id=\"u20e4be9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba078f80\" id=\"uba078f80\">示例：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ue47d39eb\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ud00b7a31\" data-lake-id=\"u46207b88\" id=\"u46207b88\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue06bbf5a\" id=\"ue06bbf5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4eb50026\" id=\"u4eb50026\">(1,0,0,1)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1f44bd85\" id=\"u1f44bd85\"> = 红色</span></li><li fid=\"ud00b7a31\" data-lake-id=\"uf0aef887\" id=\"uf0aef887\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6382ca72\" id=\"u6382ca72\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a2f7548\" id=\"u5a2f7548\">(0,1,0,1)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u518bebd3\" id=\"u518bebd3\"> = 绿色</span></li><li fid=\"ud00b7a31\" data-lake-id=\"u1f531292\" id=\"u1f531292\"><code data-lake-id=\"u307a981f\" id=\"u307a981f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8805fdd\" id=\"uf8805fdd\">(0,0,1,1)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9e1671d6\" id=\"u9e1671d6\"> = 蓝色</span></li><li fid=\"ud00b7a31\" data-lake-id=\"uefc88f34\" id=\"uefc88f34\"><code data-lake-id=\"u65dc4d90\" id=\"u65dc4d90\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc417076\" id=\"ufc417076\">(1,1,1,1)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub8b24327\" id=\"ub8b24327\"> = 白色</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tkl3S%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"083bb7d2\" id=\"083bb7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc97a2702\" id=\"uc97a2702\">5. 第三步：创建躯干（Root Link） </span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"07b55455\" id=\"07b55455\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubba40286\" id=\"ubba40286\">5.1 什么是 Root Link？ </span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2873baf9\" id=\"u2873baf9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6bdff9ef\" id=\"u6bdff9ef\">Root Link（根连杆）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueb6ad237\" id=\"ueb6ad237\"> 是整个机器人模型的基准坐标系。其他所有 Link 都是通过 Joint 连接到它的。通常选择躯干或底座作为 Root Link。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"0425b375\" id=\"0425b375\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf6d34fe\" id=\"ucf6d34fe\">5.2 添加躯干 Link </span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3C!--%20Root%20link%3A%20%E8%BA%AF%E5%B9%B2%20--%3E%5Cn%3Clink%20name%3D%5C%22torso%5C%22%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C!--%20%E8%A7%86%E8%A7%89%E5%A4%96%E8%A7%82%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%3Cvisual%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Corigin%20xyz%3D%5C%220%200%20-0.15%5C%22%20rpy%3D%5C%220%200%200%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cgeometry%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cbox%20size%3D%5C%220.25%200.18%200.30%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fgeometry%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cmaterial%20name%3D%5C%22torso_red%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C%2Fvisual%3E%5Cn%20%20%5Cn%20%20%3C!--%20%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%20--%3E%5Cn%20%20%3Cinertial%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Corigin%20xyz%3D%5C%220%200%20-0.15%5C%22%20rpy%3D%5C%220%200%200%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cmass%20value%3D%5C%228.0%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Cinertia%20ixx%3D%5C%220.10%5C%22%20ixy%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20ixz%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20iyy%3D%5C%220.12%5C%22%20iyz%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20izz%3D%5C%220.06%5C%22%2F%3E%5Cn%20%20%3C%2Finertial%3E%5Cn%3C%2Flink%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rKGLv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"b08804c3\" id=\"b08804c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58a00147\" id=\"u58a00147\">5.3 标签详解 </span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"b52d1e3f\" id=\"b52d1e3f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u38fa25b8\" id=\"u38fa25b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59c7406a\" id=\"u59c7406a\">&lt;visual&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u78e7c41d\"